        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CFMBS-833KR Decorative Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative  design appliance handle is <b>1-1/2\" diameter</b> with a <b>3-1/4\" projection</b>.  They are hand made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions in your choice of 5 standard finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panel. We believe a refrigerator needs to have a 18\" or longer pull installed to  effectively pull open todays large \"vacuum\" sealed doors such as the ones found on a Sub Zero refrigerator. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions CFMBS-833KR Decorative Appliance Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Rosette Diameter: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>This appliance pull is available in 6 different standard lengths.</b>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBS-833KR-14: Total Length 14\" - Center to Center Mount - 12-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBS-833KR-16: Total Length 16\" - Center to Center Mount - 14-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBS-833KR-18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount - 16-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBS-833KR-20: Total Length 20\" - Center to Center Mount - 18-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBS-833KR-24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount - 22-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFMBS-833KR-30: Total Length 30\" - Center to Center Mount - 28-3/8\"</li>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This appliance handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese Refrigerator pulls are supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4\" - 1\" thick panels (standard appliance panel thickness).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
